# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
bin/
obj/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Working notes and machine-generated evidence.
#
# These are how the project is developed, not part of what a player installs,
# so they stay out of the published repository.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
AGENTS.md
NOTEBOOK.md
project status.md
todo.md
dumps/
evidence/
logs/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Binaries
#
# Everything is excluded by default, then the few files a release genuinely
# needs are added back. Nothing from the game's own code is ever listed here:
# the Il2Cpp proxy assemblies MelonLoader generates are the game's own code and
# must never be published.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb
*.ptb
*.zip

# The mod itself, built on a machine that has the game installed. The release
# workflow cannot build it, because building needs those proxy assemblies.
!dist/Mods/BlindIt.dll

# Prism, the speech library the mod reaches NVDA through. MPL-2.0, so it may be
# redistributed as long as its licence and NOTICE travel with it. Both copies
# are needed: lib/ is the source of truth, dist/ is what the release zips.
!lib/prism/prism.dll
!dist/UserLibs/prism.dll

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Windows clutter
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Desktop.ini
desktop.ini
Thumbs.db

